  "[[k|2]] Powerful Darts [[d|$1.200]]: Darts move faster and can pop 3 bloons each.": "[[k|2]] Powerful Darts [[d|$1.200]]: Dartlar daha hızlı gider ve her biri 3 balon patlatabilir.",
  "[[k|4]] Bloon Area Denial System [[d|$12.000]]: 4-barreled auto-cannon that can be set to attack automatically.": "[[k|4]] Bloon Area Denial System [[d|$12.000]]: Kendiliğinden saldıracak şekilde ayarlanabilen 4 namlulu otomatik top.",
